# Focus — PR Test plan (always)

When a Focus PR exists or is being opened, **own the Test plan**. Do not leave a full unchecked list for Joviane.

## Must do (agent)

1. Run every automatable checkbox (pytest, CLI dogfood, code-path / opt-in / overlay proofs).
2. Mark `[x]` in the PR body with one-line evidence (`gh pr create` or `gh pr edit`).
3. Leave unchecked only true owner-only items (IDE click, subjective caption feel). Label those *(owner)*.

## Focus defaults (use unless the PR plan says otherwise)

| Agent runs | Owner only |
|---|---|
| `.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q` | Focus window / CodeLens paint order |
| `.venv/bin/focus audit --local …` (incl. `--llm-captions` when the plan says) | Subjective ℹ️ quality |
| Confirm no `.env` / private settings in the diff; opt-in + never on overlay | — |

**Never** open or leave a Focus PR with a full unchecked plan if those commands were runnable.

Canonical global wording: private `cursor-rules` → `rules/pr-test-plan.mdc` (same duty, all projects).
